ing in unprecedentedly vulnerable music and one song she readily admits shouldn’t work on paper but hits anyway: “Espresso,” the song that catapulted her career with four delightfully strange-sounding words: “That’s that me espresso.” “There really are no rules to the things you say,” she tells Lowe on the songwriting process. “You’re just like, what sounds awesome? What feels awesome? And what gets the story across, whatever story that is?” Still, she’s painted herself in a bit of a corner when it comes to placing an order at coffee shops worldwide: “They’re just waiting for me to say it,” she laughs. “And I’m like, ‘Tea.’”","tagline":"New Album and Interview"},"editorialVideo":{"motionDetailSquare":{"previewFrame":{"bgColor":"1a0904","gradient":{"color":"1a0904","y2":0.48},"hasP3":false,"height":3840,"textColor1":"ffffff","textColor2":"f0ab70","textColor3":"d1a68b","textColor4":"c79879","textGradient":["ffffff","f0ab70"],"url":"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Video221/v4/9c/88/c6/9c88c689-52bf-cc91-36fc-a060345970a4/Joba8d76a32-a785-4616-a890-dd79c9c02e80-173952645-PreviewImage_Preview_Image_Intermediate_nonvideo_sdr_339198909_1867067753-Time1724116307983.png/{w}x{h}bb.jpg","width":3840},"video":"https://mvod.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/HLSVideo221/v4/f9/e7/bc/f9e7bc17-b0db-3d1b-a4c7-27f666b33b0a/P899578198_default.m3u8"},"motionDetailTall":{"previewFrame":{"bgColor":"1a0904","gradient":{"color":"1a0904","y2":0.48},"hasP3":false,"height":2732,"textColor1":"ffffff","textColor2":"e0b694","textColor3":"cca482","textColor4":"b99f94","textGradient":["ffffff","e0b694"],"url":"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Video211/v4/5a/bf/a7/5abfa78a-2fed-9ad5-f93b-de1d934df8ee/Jobf3f4cc07-2942-4a2c-af28-814992289dd0-173952644-PreviewImage_Preview_Image_Intermediate_nonvideo_sdr_339198910_1867067752-Time1724114386189.png/{w}x{h}bb.jpg","width":2048},"video":"https://mvod.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/HLSVideo221/v4/28/23/22/282322aa-5758-a88a-3915-1abf28500982/P